{"_comment":"Build-time central config for a test/staging desktop build (ADR-146 step 6, staging step D). Copy this file to central.json in this same folder and fill in the real values BEFORE running electron-builder; the build ships central.json inside the app's resources folder. A normal (production) build has no central.json and stays local-only. NEVER commit a real central.json with a real key — the key belongs to the build machine only. Environment variables always win over this file.","app_id":"cc.otsi.vie.staging","app_name":"OTSI VIE Staging","central_server_url":"https://accounts.otsi.cc","data_dir":"D:\\OTSI-VIE-staging","licence_public_key_pem":"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\n...\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----\n"}